    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/071f9d88720422cc0fdaae08cdc32829.poster.avif?t=1754593368\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/071f9d88720422cc0fdaae08cdc32829.webm?t=1754593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/071f9d88720422cc0fdaae08cdc32829.mp4?t=1754593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Place and arrange components and instruments to solve sequences and build machines for your clients.  <br></li><li>Bonuses and restrictions for each job as well as open-ended solutions allow for creativity and challenge. <br></li><li>Completing machines will unlock new components and opportunities.<br></li><li>Each client has their own style and preferences.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/a2869fabf02a6a028ed98a715ad96424.poster.avif?t=1754593368\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/a2869fabf02a6a028ed98a715ad96424.webm?t=1754593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/a2869fabf02a6a028ed98a715ad96424.mp4?t=1754593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experiment in sandbox mode with all components and instruments unlocked.<br></li><li>Share your creations with other players or collaborate with friends.<br></li><li>Create your own jobs for players to solve.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/071f9d88720422cc0fdaae08cdc32829.poster.avif?t=1754593368\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/071f9d88720422cc0fdaae08cdc32829.webm?t=1754593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/071f9d88720422cc0fdaae08cdc32829.mp4?t=1754593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Place and arrange components and instruments to solve sequences and build machines for your clients.  <br></li><li>Bonuses and restrictions for each job as well as open-ended solutions allow for creativity and challenge. <br></li><li>Completing machines will unlock new components and opportunities.<br></li><li>Each client has their own style and preferences.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/a2869fabf02a6a028ed98a715ad96424.poster.avif?t=1754593368\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/a2869fabf02a6a028ed98a715ad96424.webm?t=1754593368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636350/extras/a2869fabf02a6a028ed98a715ad96424.mp4?t=1754593368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Experiment in sandbox mode with all components and instruments unlocked.<br></li><li>Share your creations with other players or collaborate with friends.<br></li><li>Create your own jobs for players to solve.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Beat 'N' Path is an open-ended logical puzzle game about timing and sequences. Build machines that play music for clients that each have specific objectives and bonuses.",
